{"ticker":{"symbol":"293780.KQ","name":"압타바이오","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":4495.0,"change_pct":-0.03747323340471087,"market_cap":126279852032.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":3870.0,"week52_high":10890.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","country":"South Korea","city":"Yongin-si","employees":44,"website":"https://www.aptabio.com","business_summary":"AptaBio Therapeutics Inc., a biopharmaceutical company, develops platform based drugs for intractable diseases. Its platforms include Oxidative stress modulation platform for developing therapeutic agents for diabetes complications, vascular diseases, neurodegenerative diseases, and intractable cancers by controlling oxidative stress; Cancer-associated fibroblast control platform for developing new anticancer drugs for intractable cancer; and Aptamer-drug conjugate platform for developing intractable anticancer drugs with high unmet medical needs. The company offers Lipofector-Q, Lipofector-EXT, Lipofector-2000, Lipofector-EZ, and Lipofector-pMAX reagents for transfecting DNA or RNA into eukaryotic cells. The company was founded in 2009 and is based in Yongin-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"앱타바이오 테라퓨틱스(AptaBio Therapeutics Inc.)는 난치성 질환에 대한 플랫폼 기반 의약품을 개발하는 바이오 제약회사입니다. 해당 플랫폼에는 산화스트레스를 조절해 당뇨병 합병증, 혈관질환, 신경변성질환, 난치성 암 치료제를 개발하는 산화스트레스 조절 플랫폼, 난치성 암에 대한 새로운 항암제 개발을 위한 암관련 섬유아세포 제어 플랫폼; 미충족 의료수요가 높은 난치성 항암제 개발을 위한 앱타머-약물접합체 플랫폼을 개발하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 진핵 세포에 DNA 또는 RNA를 형질감염시키기 위한 Lipofector-Q, Lipofector-EXT, Lipofector-2000, Lipofector-EZ 및 Lipofector-pMAX 시약을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 2009년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 용인시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"제약 (스페셜티·제네릭)","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":48352850.0,"operating_income":-9506766150.0,"net_income":-1056473